@startuml
!pragma teoz true
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam TitleFontSize 24
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1E7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F66B22
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #139D90
 LifeLineBorderColor #A5BFC2
 ParticipantBackgroundColor #183840
 ParticipantBorderColor #183840
 ParticipantFontColor white
 ActorBorderColor #183840
 ActorFontColor #183840
 GroupBorderColor #139D90
 GroupBackgroundColor #EAF6F3
 GroupHeaderFontColor #183840
 NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1E7
 NoteBorderColor #F66B22
}
actor Admin
participant Frontend as FE
participant "REST Controller" as API
participant ModerationService as S
database PostgreSQL as DB
title Review and resolve a report | US-17
Admin -> FE: Open pending reports
FE -> API: GET /api/v1/admin/reports?status=PENDING&page=0&size=20\nAuthorization: Bearer <access_token>
API -> S: listReports(token, PENDING, page, size)
S -> DB: SELECT reports WHERE status = PENDING (paged)
DB --> S: Report[] + total
S --> API: ReportPage
API --> FE: 200 OK + ReportPage { items: Report[], page, size, totalItems }
Admin -> FE: Resolve report with written outcome
FE -> API: PATCH /api/v1/admin/reports/{reportId}\nAuthorization: Bearer <access_token>\nResolveReportRequest { status: "RESOLVED", outcome }
API -> S: resolveReport(token, reportId, outcome)
S -> S: Verify JWT; require role ADMIN
alt missing / invalid / expired token
 S --> API: UNAUTHORIZED
 & API --> FE: 401 Unauthorized
else caller is not ADMIN
 S --> API: FORBIDDEN
 & API --> FE: 403 Forbidden
else caller is ADMIN
 S -> DB: SELECT report by reportId FOR UPDATE
 DB --> S: Report / none
 alt report not found
  S --> API: REPORT_NOT_FOUND
  & API --> FE: 404 Not Found
 else empty outcome or status != "RESOLVED"
  S --> API: VALIDATION_ERROR; no write
  & API --> FE: 422 Unprocessable Content
 else report already RESOLVED (terminal state)
  S --> API: STATUS_CONFLICT
  & API --> FE: 409 Conflict
 else database error
  S --> API: INTERNAL_ERROR; rolled back
  & API --> FE: 500 Internal Server Error
 else report PENDING
  S -> DB: UPDATE report: RESOLVED, outcome,\nreviewedById = sub, resolvedAt = now UTC
  DB --> S: Updated report
  S --> API: Report
  API --> FE: 200 OK + Report
 end
end
FE --> Admin: Resolved report or error message
note over S,DB: Resolving a report does not suspend the account (see 03).
@enduml
